         public key (n, e) and the message representative m to produce
         an integer ciphertext representative c:

            c = RSAEP ((n, e), m).

      c. Convert the ciphertext representative c to a ciphertext C of
         length k octets (see Section 4.1):

            C = I2OSP (c, k).



